          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this an ebook or a printed book?",
            "answer": "<p>An ebook. You get a PDF and an EPUB file by email straight after you pay, and you can read them on any phone, tablet, computer or e-reader.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between the editions?",
            "answer": "<p>The ebook is the book. Ebook and audiobook adds the full audio, read by Owen. The complete set adds the printable sleep diary as well.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I slept badly last night. Where do I start?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with chapters two and six. They take about an hour together and give you a light plan for tomorrow morning and a wind down hour for tonight.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this medical advice?",
            "answer": "<p>No. It is practical advice for ordinary bad sleep. If you snore loudly, stop breathing at night or have been sleeping badly for months, see a doctor first. Chapter one says when.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I buy copies for my team?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The team licence covers up to ten people with one invoice, useful for shift teams and night workers. For a bigger group, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">write to us</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email within 30 days and you get your money back. No questions asked.</p>"
          }
        }
